      "content": "they're okay but kinda generic tbh. people see \"supplies are limited\" and just roll their eyes. they need to see actual numbers to believe it's actually happening. can u revise them to include some specific, low stock counts or something to make it feel more real? like tell them exactly how many are left so they actually panic and click. something like \"only 15 left in stock\" or whatever works. make it look like the warehouse is almost empty.",
