      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are the revised captions with specific stock counts to create a sense of urgency:\n\n1. \"LAST CHANCE ALERT! Our Limited Edition vegan leather jackets only have 127 left in stock! Order now before they're completely gone! (link in bio) #veganleather #limitededition #shopnow\"\n2. \"WARNING: ONLY 12 PREMIUM vegan leather jackets remaining! Don't miss your chance to level up your wardrobe - shop now or risk missing out forever! (link in bio) #veganfashion #limitededitionjacket #shoptoday\"\n3. \"WAREHOUSE CLEARANCE SALE! We've got ONLY 25adows left of our best-selling Limited Edition vegan leather jacket! Snag yours now or don't say we didn't warn you when they're GONE! (link in bio) #limitededitionfashion #vegan style #shopurgently\"\n\nThese captions include specific numbers to create a sense of scarcity and make people feel like they're really close to missing out. By using specific counts like \"127 left in stock\" or \"only 12 remaining\", you're making it clear that the product is Limited Edition and that the window for purchase is quickly closing.",
